  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region enclosed by the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and the positive coordinate axes is __________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> and </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, plotting the graph of the above equation, we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/63f31ba1-d18e-406d-bfff-fbfd873431ba.png\" style=\"width: 368px; height: 251px;\"/></p><p>Now, from above diagram we get,</p><p>Required area  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math> Area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>.<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
